   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">This payment of CHF 260,005 is a contribution to the following IFRC positions that are supporting the ongoing emergency responses in the MENA Region (Libya Floods, Morocco Earthquake, Middle East Crisis):
- Recovery Senior Officer
- Roving Operations Manager
- Operations Support Officer&#xA0;
BRC will contribute 60% (CHF 260,005) of the overall costs of these positions.&#xA0;
Please note that this grant is split 50/50 between the Libya Floods appeal P9075 (CHF 130,002.5) and Morocco Earthquake appeal P9102 (CHF 130,002.5).&#xA0;
The IFRC PMN is M2402054.</narrative>
